              "type": "text",
              "settings": {
                "text": "<h1><em>Our Services</em></h1><h3><em>Fast, Reliable Jewelry, Watch & Eyewear Repair Across the U.S.</em></h3><p><br/>Fast, secure online repair for your favorite jewelry, watches, and glasses. Backed by 20+ years of expert craftsmanship, delivered straight to your door nationwide.</p><h3><em>How Our Mail-In Service Works</em></h3><p><strong>Request Your Estimate:</strong> Describe your item online for a fast, free quote.</p><p><strong>Ship Securely:</strong> Pack and send your item using our fully insured prepaid kit.</p><p><strong>Expert Repair:</strong> Master craftspeople restore your piece with real-time updates.</p><p><strong>Doorstep Delivery:</strong> Receive your restored item safely with tracked, signature delivery.</p><h3><em>What We Do</em></h3><p><strong>Jewelry Repair & Restoration</strong></p><p>From broken chains to complex structural fixes, we carefully restore gold, platinum, and silver pieces to pristine condition.</p><p><strong>Ring Sizing</strong></p><p>Seamless, precision resizing for engagement rings, wedding bands, and heirlooms—handled entirely from home.</p><p><strong>Diamond & Gemstone Setting</strong></p><p>Expert setting for custom designs or loose stones to keep your gems brilliant and secure.</p><p><strong>Precision Engraving</strong></p><p>Crisp laser and traditional engraving for custom names, dates, coordinates, or messages.</p><p><strong>Watch Repair & Overhaul</strong></p><p>Complete online watch care, including battery swaps, mechanical overhauls, and water-resistance testing.</p><p><strong>Eyewear & Sunglass Repair</strong></p><p>Rapid frame soldering, titanium welding, hinge rebuilds, and screw replacements for everyday and designer frames.</p><h3></h3><h3><em>Ready to Fix Your Favorite Items?</em><br/>Get your free online estimate in minutes. Safe & fast.</h3>",
